    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This property identifies the instance of E24 Physical Human-Made Thing that came into existence as a result of the instance of E12 Production.\nThe identity of an instance of E24 Physical Human-Made Thing is not defined by its matter, but by its existence as a subject of documentation. An E12 Production can result in the creation of multiple instances of E24 Physical Human-Made Thing."
  } ],
