    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P98i_was_born"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P98i_was_born",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P92i_was_brought_into_existence_by"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D11_Digital_Measurement_Event",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This class comprises actions measuring physical properties using a digital device, that are determined by a systematic procedure and creates an instance of D9 Data Object, which is stored on an instance of D13 Digital Information Carrier.\nIn contrast to instances of D10 Software Execution, environmental factors have an intended influence on the outcome of an instance of D11 Digital Measurement Event.\nMeasurement devices may include running distinct software, such as the RAW to JPEG conversion in digital cameras.\nIn this case, the event is regarded as instance of both classes, D10 Software Execution and D11 Digital Measurement Event."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D7_Digital_Machine_Event"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D13_Digital_Information_Carrier",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This class comprises all instances of E84 Information Carrier (in the 6.2 version of the CIDOC-CRM) that are explicitly\ndesigned to be used as persistent digital physical carriers of instances of D1\nDigital Object. A D13 Digital Information Carrier may or may not contain\ninformation, e.g., an empty diskette. \n\nNote: the entity E84 Information Carrier was a subproperty of the E22 Man-Made Object entity wich was a suproperty of the E24 entity. Therefor, the choice was made to put the D13 entity as a subproperty of E24 Physical Human-Made Thing, to keep the semantic logic."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E24_Physical_Human-Made_Thing"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D1_Digital_Object",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This class comprises identifiable immaterial items that can be represented as sets\nof bit sequences, such as data sets, e-texts, images, audio or video items, software,\netc., and are documented as single units.\nAny aggregation of instances of D1 Digital Object into a whole treated as single\nunit is also regarded as an instance of D1 Digital Object.\nThis means that for instance, the content of a DVD, an XML file on it, and an\nelement of this file, are regarded as distinct instances of D1 Digital Object,\nmutually related by the P106 is composed of (forms part of) property.\nA D1 Digital Object does not depend on a specific physical carrier, and it can\nexist on one or more carriers simultaneously."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D2_Digitization_Process",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This class comprises events that result in the creation of instances of D9 Data Object that represent the appearance and/or form of an instance of E18 Physical Thing such as paper documents, statues, buildings, paintings, etc.\nA particular case is the analogue-to-digital conversion of audiovisual material.\nThis class represents the transition from a material thing to an immaterial representation of it. \nThe characteristic subsequent processing steps on digital objects are regarded as instances of D3 Formal Derivation."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D11_Digital_Measurement_Event"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D7_Digital_Machine_Event",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This class comprises events that happen on physical digital devices following a human activity that intentionally caused its immediate or delayed initiation and results in the creation of a new instance of D1 Digital Object on behalf of the human actor. \nThe input of a D7 Digital Machine Event may be parameter settings and/or data to be processed. Some D7 Digital Machine Events may form part of a wider E65 Creation event. In this case, all machine output of the partial events is regarded as creation of the overall activity."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E11_Modification"
  }, {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E65_Creation"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D9_Data_Object",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This class comprises instances of D1 Digital Object that are the direct result of a digital measurement or a formal derivative of it, containing quantitative properties of some physical things or other constellations of matter."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E54_Dimension"
  }, {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D1_Digital_Object"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L11_had_output",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This property associates an instance of D7 Digital Machine Event with an instance of D1 Digital Object which is the output of the activity."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D7_Digital_Machine_Event"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D1_Digital_Object"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P94_has_created"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L11i_was_output_of"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L11i_was_output_of",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P94i_was_created_by"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L19_stores",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This property associates an instance of a D13 Digital Information Carrier with the instance of Digital Object that is stored on it."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D13_Digital_Information_Carrier"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D1_Digital_Object"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P128_carries"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L19i_is_stored_on"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L19i_is_stored_on",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P128i_is_carried_by"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L1_digitized",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This property associates an instance of D2 Digitization Process with an instance of E18 Physical Thing which is a material thing."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D2_Digitization_Process"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E18_Physical_Thing"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P39_measured"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L1i_was_digitized_by"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L1i_was_digitized_by",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P39i_was_measured_by"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L30_has_operator",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This property describes the activity that is being operated by a person."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E21_Person"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14_carried_out_by"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L30i_is_operator_of"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L30i_is_operator_of",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P14i_performed"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/L56_has_pixel_width",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "This property records the pixel width of the data object; it approximates a dimension that is part of the image data analysis."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain" : [ {
    "@id" : "http://www.ics.forth.gr/isl/CRMdig/D9_Data_Object"
  } ],
